      { q: 'What is the difference between composite and PVC decking?', a: 'Composite decking is made from a blend of plastic and wood fibers, while PVC is 100% synthetic plastic with no organic material, offering ultimate moisture resistance.' },
      { q: 'How long does a wood deck last in Virginia?', a: 'With rigorous annual maintenance, the surface boards of a pressure-treated wood deck typically last 10 to 15 years before needing replacement.' }
